<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hansen six-month profit rises.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hansen six-month profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Feb 28 1997</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		156.9 vs 141.9</p>
<p> Group net result		    112.3 vs  94.2</p>
<p> Group net turnover		 1,287  vs 1,039</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish medical and biotechnological products group is Chr. Hansen Holding A/S. It said in a statement that it upheld previous forecasts of a 10 percent better 1996/97 full year pre-tax profit than 1995/96's 251.2 million crowns.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
